+  filled with her pressed flower if she opened it during its members' window
+  (a flower is pressed in its room only then: MembersRoute's press and the
+  drop room both hold to inMembersWindow), and gently empty if not ("This
+  one bloomed in October"); then her keepsakes,
+  each with what it was kept for (Phase 6 adds Gathered: until the Naira
+  flower's five pieces are home, its frame lists, as links, the rooms still
+  holding one, and never how many). They are for joy, not points, never
+  redeemable: nothing here is ranked, compared or opens anything. Last,
+  "Share to story" leads to her garden card (/members/card), where the
+  garden or one of these pressed flowers becomes a picture to post.
+
+  The first time the walls come into view, each frame's gold line draws
+  itself in (stroke-dashoffset only). Under reduced motion or Data Saver the
+  frames are simply there, filled, at first paint.
+*/
